			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">疗愈师发射具有追踪性的水弹，造成<span color="#7fbfff">100%</span><span>伤害。</span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>改为造成</span><span color="#ffacff">雷元素</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="441" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">疗愈师为15m范围内的己方单位施加<span color="#ffdfbf">6单位</span><span>的</span><span color="#7fbfff">水元素</span><span>护罩。</span><span color="#ffbfff">[绝境]</span><span>改为开启</span><span color="#ffacff">雷元素</span><span>护罩。追踪机关小车不受此效果影响。</span></p>
			</content>
